    <text>
        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1459_5229.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früntlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpüwrlich</unclear> guotwillig diennst. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mitt</unclear>
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbiettung</unclear> aller erren liebs unnd guotz zuovor edell
<lb n="3"/>from errenvest fürsichtig wyß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">günstig</unclear> lieb herren,
<lb n="4"/>guot <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früündt</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpüwren</unclear>, wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wärden</unclear> ver-
<lb n="5"/>stendiget. Das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unngfarlich</unclear> vor dry <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">od</unclear> vier <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wuchen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüwrem</unclear>
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bleycher</unclear> by üch ettwas linwath ab der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bleychi</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verstollenn</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wörden</unclear>. Da nun der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thetter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unngfar</unclear> 8 ellen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einem</unclear> vonn
<lb n="8"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-187" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wattwyl</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vß</unclear> der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">graffschafft</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-199" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Doggenbuurg</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zekauffen</unclear>
<lb n="9"/>geben. Die er by unns wider <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verkaufft</unclear>. Unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alls</unclear> sy uff
<lb n="10"/>die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bleychi</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethon</unclear>, vom <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bleycher</unclear> für <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">argwünisch</unclear> geachtet.
<lb n="11"/>Unnd der guot mann dardürch inn verdacht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">komen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Allso</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thetter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachgejllt</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zü</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baden</placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erfaren</unclear>, das er
<lb n="13"/>vonnsölbiger linwath. Jnn ferber daselbst etlich ellen
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeferben</unclear> geben, damit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinzögen</unclear> unnd dieselbig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zü</unclear>
<lb n="15"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baden</placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söllte</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Innhalth</unclear> eines <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schrybens</unclear>. So unns die
<lb n="16"/>herren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schüelthis</unclear> unnd <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" resp="#ner">rath der statt</orgName> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baden</placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daruumb</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuokomen</unclear> lassen. Unnd so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßhalb</unclear> der bleycheren
<lb n="18"/>einem ettwas anngeleggen unnd verloren. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Söll</unclear> er sich
<lb n="19"/>alher begeben. Wirt man <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">s</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vß</unclear> dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Badischenn</unclear>
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schryben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zütug</unclear> geben. Wie er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zü</unclear> dem sinen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">komen</unclear>
<lb n="21"/>möge. Mögen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> auch woll mit einem schryben ann die
<lb n="22"/>herren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zü</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baden</placeName> beholffen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sin</unclear>. Was die aacht ellen
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> alhie betrifft. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Söll</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> guot <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bscheüdt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wärden</unclear>. Dessen
<lb n="24"/>haben wir üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpüwrlichem</unclear> willen unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> besten
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnberycht</unclear> nit lassen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sünnd</unclear> üch unnd den eüwren
<lb n="26"/>sampten inalleweg zedienen wolgeneigt. Damit
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">göttlichen</unclear> gnaden bevolchen. Dat <origDate when="1604" resp="#ner">mitwöch nach
<lb n="28"/>Petrij unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Paulj</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">appostollorum</unclear>. Anno 1604</origDate>.
<lb n="29"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-517" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schuelthis</unclear> unnd rath d
<lb n="30"/>statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wyl</unclear></orgName> im <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-103" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Thürgöüw</unclear></placeName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1459_5230.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="31"/>[]
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1459_5231.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1459_5232.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="32"/>Denen edlen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fromen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eerenvesten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürsichtigenn</unclear>
<lb n="33"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolweyßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herrn</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgermeister</unclear> und Rath der
<lb n="34"/>Statt Sanct Gallen</orgName>. Unnßeren günstigen
<lb n="35"/>herren, lieben fründen und Nachpeuren.
</p>
